@startuml
title 5.1 Create SePay Payment - sequence diagram
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam wrapWidth 240
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam sequence {
  LifeLineBorderColor #888888
  ParticipantBorderColor #444444
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}

actor Customer as U
participant "View" as V <<View>> #EADCFF
participant PaymentController as C <<Controller>> #D8F3DC
participant SePayGatewayService as GW <<Service>> #DCECFF
participant OrderRepository as OR <<Repository>> #FFF1C9
participant PaymentRepository as PR <<Repository>> #FFF1C9
participant "SePay Gateway\n(checkout page)" as SEPAY <<External>> #FFE0E0

== A. Where the payment starts ==
note over V
  The View starts a SePay payment from three places:
  1. right after checkout with ONLINE (4.3), one order or a group of orders;
  2. /payment/pending ("Pay again" while the 10 minutes last);
  3. the order list (pay again, deposit of a custom order, 10.2) and the success page (remaining part, FINAL).
  One order: POST /sepay/create (paymentType FULL; DEPOSIT or FINAL for custom orders).
  Several orders of one checkout: POST /sepay/create-group.
end note

== B. One order ==
U -> V : click pay
V -> C : POST /api/payments/sepay/create\n(orderId, paymentType, paymentMethod?)
C -> GW : createPayment(request, currentUser.id)
GW -> GW : secret key and merchant id configured, else 400 "Cổng thanh toán chưa được cấu hình."
GW -> GW : paymentMethod empty or CARD / BANK_TRANSFER / NAPAS_BANK_TRANSFER, else 400
GW -> OR : findByIdForUpdate(orderId)
OR --> GW : Order (row locked), else 404
alt order is not the caller's
  GW --> C : 403 Bạn không có quyền thanh toán cho đơn hàng này.
else COMPLETED
  GW --> C : 400 đã hoàn thành
else CANCELLED
  GW --> C : 400 đã bị hủy
else expired (PENDING over 10 min, AWAITING_DEPOSIT over 24 h)
  GW --> C : 400 đã hết hạn thanh toán (the scheduler cancels it, see 5.3)
else status not PENDING, AWAITING_DEPOSIT or DEPOSIT_PAID
  GW --> C : 400 không còn chờ thanh toán
else ok
  GW -> PR : findByOrderId(orderId)
  PR --> GW : List<Payment>
  alt the order has a COD payment
    GW --> C : 400 Đơn COD không thể thanh toán trực tuyến.
  else ONLINE
    GW -> GW : check paymentType against the order
    note right of GW
      STANDARD order: FULL only.
      CUSTOM order paid in full: FULL only. DEPOSIT_PAID: FINAL only.
      FINAL needs DEPOSIT_PAID. DEPOSIT is refused once the deposit is paid.
      Each mismatch is a 400 with its own message.
    end note
    alt FULL
      GW -> GW : amount = order total
    else DEPOSIT
      GW -> GW : amount = deposit of the order (50% when no deposit is stored)
    else FINAL
      GW -> GW : amount = total - successful payments (not above 0, else 400 fully paid)
    end
    loop older ONLINE payments of the same type still PENDING
      GW -> PR : save(status = FAILED)
    end
    GW -> PR : save(Payment PENDING, invoice INV-<order>-<type>-<random>)
    GW -> GW : signedCheckoutFields(invoice, amount, description, customerId, method)
    note right of GW : fields in order, last one is the HMAC signature;\nsuccess, error and cancel URL carry ?invoice_number=<invoice>
    GW --> C : CreatePaymentResponse(checkoutUrl, paymentId, invoiceNumber, orderId, amount, fields)
    C --> V : 200 OK
  end
end

== C. Several orders in one payment ==
U -> V : click pay (orders created together at checkout)
V -> C : POST /api/payments/sepay/create-group\n(orderIds, paymentMethod?)
C -> GW : createGroupPayment(request, currentUser.id)
GW -> GW : same configuration and method checks as B
loop order ids, distinct and sorted
  GW -> OR : findByIdForUpdate(id)
  OR --> GW : Order (404 when missing)
  GW -> GW : owner (403), STANDARD and PENDING (400), not expired (400)
  GW -> PR : findByOrderId(id)
  PR --> GW : payments (a COD payment: 400)
end
GW -> GW : groupInvoice = GRP-<16 random>
loop each order
  GW -> PR : older ONLINE PENDING payments to FAILED
  GW -> PR : save(Payment FULL PENDING, amount = order total, groupInvoice)
end
GW -> GW : signedCheckoutFields(groupInvoice, sum of totals, "Thanh toan N don hoa", ...)
GW --> C : CreatePaymentResponse(invoiceNumber = groupInvoice, amount = total, fields)
C --> V : 200 OK

== D. Go to SePay ==
V -> V : remember the invoice in sessionStorage (flower_pending_invoice)
V -> SEPAY : POST hidden form with the signed fields (browser leaves the app)
SEPAY --> U : payment page
note over SEPAY
  The result comes back through the return URLs and is confirmed by the backend, see 5.2.
  A failure to create the payment shows the message in the page (and checkout goes to /payment/pending).
end note

@enduml
